>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `CS_BESTSIMP_TAC`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.CS_BESTSIMP_TAC :
  clasetLib.claset -> simpLib.simpset -> tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Constructs the context-explicit form of `BESTSIMP_TAC`.

`CS_BESTSIMP_TAC cs ss` runs best-first classical search with
assumption-aware full simplification from `ss` installed as an unsafe
wrapper on `cs`. It reads no global clasimp state and processes no theorem
list.

### Failure

Fails unless search closes the goal before frontier exhaustion or
`clasetSearch.node_limit`.

### Example

``` hol4
val bestsimp =
  clasimpLib.CS_BESTSIMP_TAC
    (clasetLib.the_claset ()) (clasimpLib.clasimp_ss ());
```

